on using distant supervision: A survey."},{"id":"c22","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_5912c0ee4708739b","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":19,"quote":"REANO [106] extracts the entities and relations from a set of passages using traditional entity recognition (ER) and relation extraction (RE) methods, respectively."},{"id":"c23","chunkId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3_c_c323dac287f0e733","docId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3","docTitle":"2404.03868_Extract_Define_Canonicalize_An_LLM_based_Framework_for_Knowledge_Graph","page":14,"quote":"It successfully recovers the subtle and fine-grained relation ‘selectedByNasa’ that would have been missed without using the hint."},{"id":"c24","chunkId":"bd72eebf611df136_c_fd55b403be7cf9e3","docId":"bd72eebf611df136","docTitle":"2410.05779_LightRAG_Simple_and_Fast_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":3,"quote":"P(·): We employ a LLM-empowered profiling function, P(·), to generate a text key-value pair (K, V ) for each entity node in V and relation edge in E."},{"id":"c25","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_d7ac331ccca2797d","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":22,"quote":"MVP-Tuning [164] considers combining multiple facts that share the same subject and relation to remove redundant information."},{"id":"c26","chunkId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3_c_a02c99d7879ea2fe","docId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3","docTitle":"2404.03868_Extract_Define_Canonicalize_An_LLM_based_Framework_for_Knowledge_Graph","page":11,"quote":"Distant supervision for relation extraction via piecewise convolutional neural networks."},{"id":"c27","chunkId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17_c_094839f1a26f99da","docId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17","docTitle":"2304.09542_Is_ChatGPT_Good_at_Search_Investigating_Large_Language_Models_as_Re_Ra","page":9,"quote":"Therefore, there is a need for fur- ther exploration into effectively utilizing LLMs to enhance the first-stage retrieval and improve th